				1505,
				80
			],
			"Message": "Refactor and document various modules for clarity and maintainability\n\n- Updated documentation across multiple modules to improve clarity and consistency, including the SecretProvider, CoreError, IPC, and Telemetry modules.\n- Removed outdated TODO comments and added status updates for zero callers as of 2026-05-02.\n- Enhanced comments to better describe the responsibilities and architectural roles of various components.\n- Cleaned up code by removing unused sections and ensuring that all modules are properly documented for future reference.\n- Improved error handling documentation in CoreError to reflect the current state of the error taxonomy.\n- Adjusted IPC module comments to clarify its role in the Mountain application architecture.\n- Updated the RunTime module documentation to reflect its responsibilities in executing effects through the Echo scheduler.\n- Refined comments in the UpdateService to indicate the current status of update checks and their integration with the main binary.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "9726005e3eeb102aaf2f93b0a4c9bfc64dc4c2a4"
		},
